        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Abanyamowabu n’ab’i Seyiri ko bavuga, bat’ Ereg’ inzu ya Yuda ihwanye n’iz’ ayandi mahanga yose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuko rero, mu gihugu c’i Mowabu, aharābana n’ibisagara vyaho, uhereye ku bisagara biri ku mbibe zaho, ari vyo biteye igihugu icubahiro, ni vyo Beti‐Yeshimoti n’i Bayali‐Meyoni n’i Kiriyatayimu, ngira mpace ikirengero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
