              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyedomu nzobīhōra ntumye abantu banje b’ Abisirayeli; bazogirira Abanyedomu nk’uk’ uburake n’inzigo mbafitiye biri: maze bazomenya ukwīhōra kwanje ic’ ari co, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize.",
          "type": "text",
